UID:stanford_campus-localist-53741879906067-53741879907094@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Perimenopause can bring changes in sleep\, energy\, mood\, bod
 y composition\, and overall well-being. Although food cannot prevent the n
 atural hormonal changes that occur during this stage of life\, research su
 ggests that dietary patterns and lifestyle choices can help manage symptom
 s and support long-term muscle\, bone\, brain\, metabolic\, and cardiovasc
 ular health.\n\nJoin us for a virtual cooking demonstration focused on cre
 ating satisfying\, practical meals during perimenopause and menopause. Thr
 ough r\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://healthyliving.stanford.edu/class
 es/register/class_detail.php?t=1cce34dfd3cbss383d348a508b1be48cc821&ci=125
 2816\nLast synced: 2026-09-28 13:01 PDT
