UID:stanford_campus-localist-53741879948057-53741879949084@local-events
DESCRIPTION:While commonly recognized as a smart way to save tax-free for 
 current medical expenses\, Health Savings Accounts (HSAs) offer so much mo
 re. In fact\, they may be one of the best tools for building retirement sa
 vings.\n\nJoin us for a free webinar that will demystify HSAs and highligh
 t their full potential. We will cover the fundamentals of HSAs\, including
  how to use them effectively to save on tax-free contributions for today
 ’s medical expenses. Combined with reduced premiums from high-deductible
  he\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://healthyliving.stanford.edu/classes/
 register/class_detail.php?t=1cce34dfd3cbss383d348a508b1be48cc821&ci=125283
 5\nLast synced: 2026-09-28 13:01 PDT
